email/templates/TicketMagic_Organizer_Pitch_ABC_by_Segment.docx, section 7.

To build a letter here, clone an existing one from ../02, ../03 or ../04
rather than starting from email/templates/email-corporate.html. The three
versions of a segment must stay structurally identical, so the module each
one leads on is the only variable under test.

This file exists so git keeps the folder. Delete it once the folder holds
a letter.
